"download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-30T10:11:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T10:11:34Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.96.2/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.96.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.96.2","body":"### Fixed\n\n- *(deps)* link the plan store that sends no write when an unchanged plan is copied again ([#1302](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1302))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.9.1 | `0.9.0` | 0.9.1 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.57.4 | `0.57.4` | 0.57.4 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.19.26 | `0.19.26` | 0.19.26 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.22.1 | `0.22.1` | 0.22.1 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.29.1 | `0.29.1` | 0.29.1 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.12.12 | `=0.12.12` | 0.12.12 |\n| `onetaskgraph-plugin-api` | 0.12.12 | `=0.12.12` | 0.12.12 |\n| `onetaskgraph-local-md` | 0.12.12 | `=0.12.12` | 0.12.12 |\n| `onemessagebus` | 0.9.4 | `0.9.3` | 0.9.4 |\n| `onebudgetspec-core` | 0.1.5 | `=0.1.5` | 0.1.5 |\n\nEvery linked engine is the newest its own requirement permits.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/428691552","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/428691552/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/428691552/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.96.1","id":428691552,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis"