ations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":615,"digest":"sha256:552096c5d06e79b78ece31bcf76876d01dd31ece6bf463bd1e6be5baedf85b91","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-30T04:03:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T04:03:42Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.96.0/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.96.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.96.0","body":"### Added\n\n- declare additive human action item contracts ([#1297](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1297))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(deps)* link the onevcs whose public boundary check never refuses a removal ([#1301](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1301))\n- prove the human items schema exporter without compiling inside a test ([#1304](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1304))\n- *(deps)* link the store that lets a private GitHub home hold public tasks ([#1299](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1299))\n- *(test)* keep the pooled-slot tier green on Windows, where its tests do not apply ([#1295](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1295))\n- *(npm)* keep the Windows node_modules/.bin launch's output the engine's own ([#1291](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1291))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | **0.9.0** | `0.9.0` | **0.9.1** — this release is behind it |\n| `onevcs` | 0.57.4 | `0.57.4` | 0.57.4 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.19.26 | `0.19.26` | 0.19.26 |\n| `onejudge` | **0.22.0** | `0.22.0` | **0.22.1** — this release is behind it |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.29.1 | `0.29.1` | 0.29.1 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.12.11 | `=0.12.11` | 0.12.11 |\n| `onetaskgraph-plugin-api` | 0.12.11 | `=0.12.11` | 0.12.11 |\n| `onetaskgraph-local-md` | 0.12.11 | `=0.12.11` | 0.12.11 |\n| `onemessagebus` | 0.9.4 | `0.9.3` | 0.9.4 |\n| `onebudgetspec-core` | 0.1.5 | `=0.1.5` | 0.1.5 |\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This release links an engine **older than its own requirement permits**, so reading\n> `Cargo.toml` overstates what this build contains:\n>\n> - `oneagentgraph` links 0.9.0; the requirement already permitted 0.9.1.\n> - `onejudge` links 0.22.0; the requirement already permitted 0.22.1.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/427885638","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/427885638/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/427885638/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.95.7","id":427885638,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organiz