.7/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.95.7","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.95.7","body":"### Fixed\n\n- *(test)* make the post-adoption driver panic journey reliable on a loaded runner ([#1285](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1285))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | **0.9.0** | `0.9.0` | **0.9.1** — this release is behind it |\n| `onevcs` | **0.57.0** | `0.57.0` | **0.57.3** — this release is behind it |\n| `onevcs-testing` | **0.19.22** | `0.19.22` | **0.19.25** — this release is behind it |\n| `onejudge` | 0.22.0 | `0.22.0` | 0.22.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.29.1 | `0.29.1` | 0.29.1 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.12.9 | `=0.12.9` | 0.12.9 |\n| `onetaskgraph-plugin-api` | 0.12.9 | `=0.12.9` | 0.12.9 |\n| `onetaskgraph-local-md` | 0.12.9 | `=0.12.9` | 0.12.9 |\n| `onemessagebus` | 0.9.4 | `0.9.3` | 0.9.4 |\n| `onebudgetspec-core` | 0.1.5 | `=0.1.5` | 0.1.5 |\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This release links an engine **older than its own requirement permits**, so reading\n> `Cargo.toml` overstates what this build contains:\n>\n> - `oneagentgraph` links 0.9.0; the requirement already permitted 0.9.1.\n> - `onevcs` links 0.57.0; the requirement already permitted 0.57.3.\n> - `onevcs-testing` links 0.19.22; the requirement already permitted 0.19.25.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/427715631","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/427715631/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/427715631/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.95.6","id":42