","updated_at":"2026-10-27T05:39:00Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.95.1/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.95.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.95.1","body":"### Fixed\n\n- *(test)* stop two tests failing slow Windows runners on wall-clock bounds ([#1228](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1228))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.9.0 | `0.9.0` | 0.9.0 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.57.0 | `0.57.0` | 0.57.0 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.19.22 | `0.19.22` | 0.19.22 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.22.0 | `0.22.0` | 0.22.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.29.1 | `0.29.1` | 0.29.1 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.12.5 | `=0.12.5` | 0.12.5 |\n| `onetaskgraph-plugin-api` | 0.12.5 | `=0.12.5` | 0.12.5 |\n| `onetaskgraph-local-md` | 0.12.5 | `=0.12.5` | 0.12.5 |\n| `onemessagebus` | 0.9.4 | `0.9.3` | 0.9.4 |\n| `onebudgetspec-core` | 0.1.5 | `=0.1.5` | 0.1.5 |\n\nEvery linked engine is the newest its own requirement permits.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/424611548","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/424611548/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/424611548/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.95.0","id":424611548,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api