view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":615,"digest":"sha256:cb99b5147e254b8fe9d8f5a1ad328368db27d02d6665aea627466efd11310e65","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:03:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T19:03:37Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.95.0/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.95.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.95.0","body":"### Added\n\n- *(deps)* [**breaking**] link the plan store that records what Linear stores from each write ([#1212](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1212))\n\n### Performance\n\n- *(driver)* keep a driver's cost flat however large its journal grows, with liveness out of it ([#1200](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1200))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.9.0 | `0.9.0` | 0.9.0 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.57.0 | `0.57.0` | 0.57.0 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.19.22 | `0.19.22` | 0.19.22 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.22.0 | `0.22.0` | 0.22.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.29.1 | `0.29.1` | 0.29.1 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.12.5 | `=0.12.5` | 0.12.5 |\n| `onetaskgraph-plugin-api` | 0.12.5 | `=0.12.5` | 0.12.5 |\n| `onetaskgraph-local-md` | 0.12.5 | `=0.12.5` | 0.12.5 |\n| `onemessagebus` | 0.9.4 | `0.9.3` | 0.9.4 |\n| `onebudgetspec-core` | 0.1.5 | `=0.1.5` | 0.1.5 |\n\nEvery linked engine is the newest its own requirement permits.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/423997647","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/423997647/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickd