user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":616,"digest":"sha256:0c6f8b7e9104a3457306f5cdb6884ae268b8c09b95e0901115f93cb8000dc777","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-25T21:59:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T21:59:59Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.92.0/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.92.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.92.0","body":"### Added\n\n- *(deps)* [**breaking**] link the onevcs whose private-term check honours a host's public phrases ([#1205](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1205))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(test)* hold the loop-cost journey to when the loop reads, not how many passes a slow runner completes ([#1206](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1206))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.8.0 | `0.8.0` | 0.8.0 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.57.0 | `0.57.0` | 0.57.0 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.19.22 | `0.19.22` | 0.19.22 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.21.0 | `0.21.0` | 0.21.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.29.1 | `0.29.1` | 0.29.1 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.12.1 | `=0.12.1` | 0.12.1 |\n| `onetaskgraph-plugin-api` | 0.12.1 | `=0.12.1` | 0.12.1 |\n| `onetaskgraph-local-md` | 0.12.1 | `=0.12.1` | 0.12.1 |\n| `onemessagebus` | **0.9.3** | `0.9.3` | **0.9.4** — this release is behind it |\n| `onebudgetspec-core` | 0.1.5 | `=0.1.5` | 0.1.5 |\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This release links an engine **older than its own requirement permits**, so reading\n> `Cargo.toml` overstates what this build contains:\n>\n> - `onemessagebus` links 0.9.3; the requirement already permitted 0.9.4.\n"},{"url":"https:/