netaskgraph-local-md` | 0.12.1 | `=0.12.1` | 0.12.1 |\n| `onemessagebus` | **0.9.3** | `0.9.3` | **0.9.4** — this release is behind it |\n| `onebudgetspec-core` | 0.1.5 | `=0.1.5` | 0.1.5 |\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A newer release of an engine below exists that this build's own requirements\n> **hold back**: it requires a sibling engine outside the window `Cargo.toml` states,\n> so no `cargo update` takes it without a second copy of that sibling, and only a\n> requirement move lifts it:\n>\n> - `onevcs-testing` links 0.19.21, the newest its requirement permits that this manifest admits; 0.19.22 is held back by `onevcs = \"0.56.11\"` (0.19.22 requires onevcs =0.57.0).\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This release links an engine **older than its own requirement permits**, so reading\n> `Cargo.toml` overstates what this build contains:\n>\n> - `onemessagebus` links 0.9.3; the requirement already permitted 0.9.4.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/423293396","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/423293396/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/423293396/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.91.0","id":423293396,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/u