owing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":616,"digest":"sha256:1fc4e48ffb3c2cc1207cda496a4cca0f3472cb615cdbad17f564e61eb026691b","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-24T12:06:08Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:06:08Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.89.0/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.89.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.89.0","body":"### Added\n\n- *(deps)* [**breaking**] link the agent graph whose turn records point at the transcript, and onevcs's check times ([#1120](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1120))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(watch)* never return a cursor past a record the watch did not emit ([#1134](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1134))\n- *(tests)* keep the three-manager landing and public-id claim journeys reliable ([#1132](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1132))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.8.0 | `0.8.0` | 0.8.0 |\n| `onevcs` | **0.56.9** | `0.56.9` | **0.56.10** — this release is behind it |\n| `onevcs-testing` | **0.19.19** | `0.19.19` | **0.19.20** — this release is behind it |\n| `onejudge` | 0.21.0 | `0.21.0` | 0.21.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.29.1 | `0.29.1` | 0.29.1 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.11.1 | `=0.11.1` | 0.11.1 |\n| `onetaskgraph-plugin-api` | 0.11.1 | `=0.11.1` | 0.11.1 |\n| `onetaskgraph-local-md` | 0.11.1 | `=0.11.1` | 0.11.1 |\n| `onemessagebus` | 0.9.3 | `0.9.3` | 0.9.3 |\n| `onebudgetspec-core` | 0.1.5 | `=0.1.5` | 0.1.5 |\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This release links an engine **older than its own requirement permits**, so reading\n> `Cargo.toml` overstates what this build contains:\n>\n> - `onevcs` links 0.56.9; the requirement already permitted 0.56.10.\n> - `onevcs-testing` links 0.19.19; the requirement already permitted 0.19.20.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/422585673","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/422585673/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/422585673/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.88.1","id":422585673,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"ht