d_at":"2026-10-24T00:36:40Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.88.0/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.88.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.88.0","body":"### Added\n\n- *(adopt)* let an adoption revise the run's per-item write-back budget ([#1122](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1122))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(tests)* keep the observer-finished and refused-note tests reliable on Windows ([#1114](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1114))\n- *(deps)* move tokio past RUSTSEC-2026-0386 ([#1127](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1127))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.7.1 | `0.7.1` | 0.7.1 |\n| `onevcs` | **0.56.5** | `0.56.3` | **0.56.9** — this release is behind it |\n| `onevcs-testing` | **0.19.15** | `0.19.13` | **0.19.19** — this release is behind it |\n| `onejudge` | 0.20.0 | `0.20.0` | 0.20.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.28.8 | `0.28.8` | 0.28.8 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.11.0 | `=0.11.0` | 0.11.0 |\n| `onetaskgraph-plugin-api` | 0.11.0 | `=0.11.0` | 0.11.0 |\n| `onetaskgraph-local-md` | 0.11.0 | `=0.11.0` | 0.11.0 |\n| `onemessagebus` | 0.9.3 | `0.9.3` | 0.9.3 |\n| `onebudgetspec-core` | 0.1.5 | `=0.1.5` | 0.1.5 |\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This release links an engine **older than its own requirement permits**, so reading\n> `Cargo.toml` overstates what this build contains:\n>\n> - `onevcs` links 0.56.5; the requirement already permitted 0.56.9.\n> - `onevcs-testing` links 0.19.15; the requirement already permitted 0.19.19.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/421924377","assets_url":"https: