58:13Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.85.0/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.85.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.85.0","body":"### Added\n\n- *(edits)* [**breaking**] carry a live-added task's image assets onto the board ([#1106](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1106))\n- *(views)* refresh a run view from only what its journal appended ([#1105](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1105))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.7.1 | `0.7.1` | 0.7.1 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.56.5 | `0.56.3` | 0.56.5 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.19.15 | `0.19.13` | 0.19.15 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.20.0 | `0.20.0` | 0.20.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.28.8 | `0.28.8` | 0.28.8 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.10.0 | `=0.10.0` | 0.10.0 |\n| `onetaskgraph-plugin-api` | 0.10.0 | `=0.10.0` | 0.10.0 |\n| `onetaskgraph-local-md` | 0.10.0 | `=0.10.0` | 0.10.0 |\n| `onemessagebus` | 0.9.3 | `0.9.3` | 0.9.3 |\n| `onebudgetspec-core` | 0.1.5 | `=0.1.5` | 0.1.5 |\n\nEvery linked engine is the newest its own requirement permits.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/420852115","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/420852115/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/420852115/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.84.1","id":420852115,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://ap