/v0.82.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.82.0","body":"### Added\n\n- *(deps)* [**breaking**] link the store that verifies Linear copies, and give each run a public id ([#1080](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1080))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.7.0 | `0.7.0` | 0.7.0 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.56.3 | `0.56.3` | 0.56.3 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.19.13 | `0.19.13` | 0.19.13 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.20.0 | `0.20.0` | 0.20.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.28.7 | `0.28.5` | 0.28.7 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.9.2 | `=0.9.2` | 0.9.2 |\n| `onetaskgraph-plugin-api` | 0.9.2 | `=0.9.2` | 0.9.2 |\n| `onetaskgraph-local-md` | 0.9.2 | `=0.9.2` | 0.9.2 |\n| `onemessagebus` | 0.9.3 | `0.9.3` | 0.9.3 |\n| `onebudgetspec-core` | 0.1.5 | `=0.1.5` | 0.1.5 |\n\nEvery linked engine is the newest its own requirement permits.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/419288307","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/419288307/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/419288307/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.81.0","id":419288307,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"htt