` | 0.6.0 | `0.6.0` | 0.6.0 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.56.3 | `0.56.3` | 0.56.3 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.19.13 | `0.19.13` | 0.19.13 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.20.0 | `0.20.0` | 0.20.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | **0.28.6** | `0.28.5` | **0.28.7** — this release is behind it |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.9.0 | `=0.9.0` | 0.9.0 |\n| `onetaskgraph-plugin-api` | 0.9.0 | `=0.9.0` | 0.9.0 |\n| `onetaskgraph-local-md` | 0.9.0 | `=0.9.0` | 0.9.0 |\n| `onemessagebus` | 0.9.3 | `0.9.3` | 0.9.3 |\n| `onebudgetspec-core` | 0.1.5 | `=0.1.5` | 0.1.5 |\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This release links an engine **older than its own requirement permits**, so reading\n> `Cargo.toml` overstates what this build contains:\n>\n> - `oneharness-core` links 0.28.6; the requirement already permitted 0.28.7.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/418399352","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/418399352/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/418399352/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.80.0","id":418399352,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick