arball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.79.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.79.2","body":"### Fixed\n\n- *(e2e)* keep the busy review round within its bound on Windows ([#1047](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1047))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.5.14 | `0.5.14` | 0.5.14 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.56.3 | `0.56.3` | 0.56.3 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.19.13 | `0.19.13` | 0.19.13 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.19.5 | `0.19.5` | 0.19.5 |\n| `oneharness-core` | **0.28.5** | `0.28.5` | **0.28.6** — this release is behind it |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.8.0 | `=0.8.0` | 0.8.0 |\n| `onetaskgraph-plugin-api` | 0.8.0 | `=0.8.0` | 0.8.0 |\n| `onetaskgraph-local-md` | 0.8.0 | `=0.8.0` | 0.8.0 |\n| `onemessagebus` | **0.9.2** | `0.9.1` | **0.9.3** — this release is behind it |\n| `onebudgetspec-core` | 0.1.5 | `=0.1.5` | 0.1.5 |\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This release links an engine **older than its own requirement permits**, so reading\n> `Cargo.toml` overstates what this build contains:\n>\n> - `oneharness-core` links 0.28.5; the requirement already permitted 0.28.6.\n> - `onemessagebus` links 0.9.2; the requirement already permitted 0.9.3.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/417971174","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/417971174/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/417971174/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.79.1","id":417971174,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","g