"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":22282735,"digest":"sha256:c7b58c3a955a03833c3c647bd03b1016f6b682bb23e8511477a37a4e6d6a4456","download_count":19,"created_at":"2026-10-20T00:30:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T00:30:05Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.79.0/onepipeline-v0.79.0-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/assets/657887689","id":657887689,"node_id":"RA_kwDOTx8aUc4nNpHJ","name":"release-outcome.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":616,"digest":"sha256:9dd7b7fbe7ad477cd48c2500c8151d85c7e4f170cb9c315f1e1d2cf8a70afd42","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-20T01:05:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T01:05:54Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.79.0/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.79.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.79.0","body":"### Added\n\n- *(writeback)* [**breaking**] move the issues a landing closes to done ([#1036](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1036))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(deps)* link the harness core that shares one Codex app-server across dispatches ([#1028](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1028))\n- *(review)* bring the review-round quota budget and its Windows reporter test back to green ([#1031](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1031))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.5.14 | `0.5.14` | 0.5.14 |\n| `onevcs` | **0.56.2** | `0.56.2` | **0.56.3** — this release is behind it |\n| `onevcs-testing` | **0.19.12** | `0.19.12` | **0.19.13** — this release is behind it |\n| `onejudge` | 0.19.5 | `0.19.5` | 0.19.5 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.28.5 | `0.28.5` | 0.28.5 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.8.0 | `=0.8.0` | 0.8.0 |\n| `onetaskgraph-plugin-api` | 0.8.0 | `=0.8.0` | 0.8.0 |\n| `onetaskgraph-local-md` | 0.8.0 | `=0.8.0` | 0.8.0 |\n| `onemessagebus` | **0.9.1** | `0.9.1` | **0.9.3** — this release is behind it |\n| `onebudgetspec-core` | 0.1.5 | `=0.1.5` | 0.1.5 |\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This release links an engine **older than its own requirement permits**, so reading\n> `Cargo.toml` overstates what this build contains:\n>\n> - `onevcs` links 0.56.2; the requirement already permitted 0.56.3.\n> - `onevcs-testing` links 0.19.12; the requirement already permitted 0.19.13.\n> - `onemessagebus` links 0.9.1; the requirement already permitted 0.9.3.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/417114004","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/417114004/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/417114004/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.78.0","id":417114004,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOTx8aUc4Y3KeU","tag_name":"v0.78.0","target_commitish":"main","name":"v0.78.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-19T09:29:03Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T10:10:16Z","published_at":"2026-10-19T09:29:05Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/assets/655856845","id":655856845,"node_id":"RA_kwDOTx8aUc4nF5TN","name":"onepipeline-v0.78.0-aarch64-apple-darwin.sha256","label":"","upload