ion's refusal on every platform ([#1001](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1001))\n- *(tests)* keep the debuginfo build check within its bound beside the rest of its tier ([#1021](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1021))\n- *(e2e)* publish the GitHub loopback endpoint's URL atomically ([#986](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/986))\n- *(e2e)* settle a two-source run within its documented bound on every platform ([#1016](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1016))\n- *(continuation)* never dispatch a node the displaced driver settled ([#1014](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1014))\n- *(scratch)* record a retained dispatch's scratch path as the dispatch was given it on Windows ([#969](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/969))\n- *(e2e)* accept a cut-short sweep's record in the maintenance journey and hold the cut with failpoints ([#999](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/999))\n- *(readjust)* hold a deferred republication's outstanding check verdict until the views read it ([#1013](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1013))"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/416601741","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/416601741/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/416601741/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.76.0","id":416601741,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"http