m/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":616,"digest":"sha256:1cbb27e0d823acd32cc2b0407664e1d50e82e3edb1abddfeea041c236367099f","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-16T12:30:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T12:30:15Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.74.1/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.74.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.74.1","body":"### Added\n\n- run each repository's declared pool maintenance and report what it freed ([#911](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/911))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(deps)* adopt the plan store that copies a private source's documents ([#943](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/943))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.5.7 | `0.5.6` | 0.5.7 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.52.0 | `0.52.0` | 0.52.0 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.19.4 | `0.19.4` | 0.19.4 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.19.0 | `0.19.0` | 0.19.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.24.2 | `0.24.1` | 0.24.2 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.7.1 | `=0.7.1` | 0.7.1 |\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A newer release of an engine below exists that this build's own requirements\n> **hold back**: it requires a sibling engine outside the window `Cargo.toml` states,\n> so no `cargo update` takes it without a second copy of that sibling, and only a\n> requirement move lifts it:\n>\n> - `oneagentgraph` links 0.5.7, the newest its requirement permits that this manifest admits; 0.5.13 is held back by `oneharness-core = \"0.24.1\"` (0.5.13 requires oneharness-core ^0.28.1).\n> - `onejudge` links 0.19.0, the newest its requirement permits that this manifest admits; 0.19.5 is held back by `oneharness-core = \"0.24.1\"` (0.19.5 requires oneharness-core ^0.28.1).\n\nEvery linked engine is the newest its own requirement permits among the releases this manifest admits.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/414616244","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/414616244/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/414616244/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.74.0","id":414616244,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOTx8aUc4Ytoq0","tag_name":"v0.74.0","target_commitish":"main","name":"v0.74.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-16T06:17:03Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T07:41:05Z","published_at":"2026-10-16T06:17:05Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/assets/646559068","id":646559068,"node_id":"RA_kwDOTx8aUc4mibVc","name":"release-outcome.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":612,"digest":"sha256:868667d4190eea34258e8a803ee9ec8f3f29215f9aa39ea881ff4b544b1bbbe6","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-16T07:41:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T07:41:05Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.74.0/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.74.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.74.0","body":"### Added\n\n- *(scratch)* [**breaking**] remove a successful run's dispatch scratch and report what other endings keep ([#910](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/910))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.5.7 | `0.5.6` | 0.5.7 |\n| `onevcs` | **0.51.2** | `0.51.2` | **0.51.3** — this release is behind it |\n| `onevcs-testing` | **0.19.2** | `0.19.2` | **0.19.3** — this release is behind it |\n| `onejudge` | 0.19.0 | `0.19.0` | 0.19.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.24.2 | `0.24.1` | 0.24.2 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.7.0 | `=0.7.0` | 0.7.0 |\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A newer release of an engine below exists that this build's own requirements\n> **hold back**: it requires a sibling engine outside the window `Cargo.toml` states,\n> so no `cargo update` takes it without a second copy of that sibling, and only a\n> requirement move lifts it:\n>\n> - `oneagentgraph` links 0.5.7, the newest its requirement permits that this manifest admits; 0.5.13 is held back by `oneharness-core = \"0.24.1\"` (0.5.13 requires oneharness-core ^0.28.1).\n> - `onejudge` links 0.19.0, the newest its requirement permits that this manifest admits; 0.19.5 is held back by `oneharness-core = \"0.24.1\"` (0.19.5 requires oneharness-core ^0.28.1).\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This release links an engine **older than its own requirement permits**, so reading\n> `Cargo.toml` overstates what this build contains:\n>\n> - `onevcs` links 0.51.2; the requirement already permitted 0.51.3.\n> - `onevcs-testing` links 0.19.2; the requirement already permitted 0.19.3 (0.19.4 is held back by `onevcs = \"0.51.2\"`: 0.19.4 requires onevcs =0.52.0).\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderoberti