ine/releases/download/v0.71.0/onepipeline-v0.71.0-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.sha256"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/assets/638307903","id":638307903,"node_id":"RA_kwDOTx8aUc4mC84_","name":"onepipeline-v0.71.0-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-gtar","state":"uploaded","size":19797649,"digest":"sha256:38c52710e9f6c67e8353857628ee28edd06e9e3ceafef34c4c1d26826c474d53","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-13T21:31:24Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T21:31:25Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.71.0/onepipeline-v0.71.0-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.71.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.71.0","body":"### Added\n\n- *(review)* bring review comments into a run with their state read from the host ([#891](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/891))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(e2e)* stop the Windows e2e journeys failing on timing alone ([#892](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/892))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | **0.5.6** | `0.5.6` | **0.5.7** — this release is behind it |\n| `onevcs` | 0.49.0 | `0.49.0` | 0.49.0 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.18.0 | `0.18.0` | 0.18.0 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.19.0 | `0.19.0` | 0.19.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.24.2 | `0.24.1` | 0.24.2 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.6.0 | `=0.6.0` | 0.6.0 |\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A newer release of an engine below exists that this build's own requirements\n> **hold back**: it requires a sibling engine outside the window `Cargo.toml` states,\n> so no `cargo update` takes it without a second copy of that sibling, and only a\n> requirement move lifts it:\n>\n> - `onevcs-testing` links 0.18.0, the newest its requirement permits that this manifest admits; 0.18.1 is held back by `onevcs = \"0.49.0\"` (0.18.1 requires onevcs =0.50.0).\n> - `onejudge` links 0.19.0, the newest its requirement permits that this manifest admits; 0.19.2 is held back by `oneharness-core = \"0.24.1\"` (0.19.2 requires oneharness-core ^0.26.0).\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This release links an engine **older than its own requirement permits**, so reading\n> `Cargo.toml` overstates what this build contains:\n>\n> - `oneagentgraph` links 0.5.6; the requirement already permitted 0.5.7 (0.5.9 is held back by `oneharness-core = \"0.24.1\"`: 0.5.9 requires oneharness-core ^0.26.0).\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/411599354","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/