{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":616,"digest":"sha256:b8ac375040917d3e372fd773b0032a79534aebea5c1dd36599097ea22f1dda42","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-13T17:07:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:07:01Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.70.0/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.70.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.70.0","body":"### Added\n\n- *(channel)* rework a settled review draft on its own branch and restack the drafts above it ([#865](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/865))\n- *(deps)* [**breaking**] link the onetaskgraph release that carries comments on copy and caches remote sources ([#884](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/884))\n- *(unpublished)* answer whether a session owes a preserved branch, natively in the stop guard ([#828](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/828))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(hooks)* remove CI-duplicated pre-push checks ([#887](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/887))\n- *(deps)* link the onevcs release that keeps a draft while work on its head still runs ([#875](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/875))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | **0.5.6** | `0.5.6` | **0.5.7** — this release is behind it |\n| `onevcs` | 0.48.1 | `0.48.1` | 0.48.1 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.17.0 | `0.17.0` | 0.17.0 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.19.0 | `0.19.0` | 0.19.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.24.2 | `0.24.1` | 0.24.2 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.6.0 | `=0.6.0` | 0.6.0 |\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This release links an engine **older than its own requirement permits**, so reading\n> `Cargo.toml` overstates what this build contains:\n>\n> - `oneagentgraph` links 0.5.6; the requirement already permitted 0.5.7.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/410968117","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/410968117/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/410968117/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.69.0","id":410968117,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOTx8aUc4YfuA1","tag_name":"v0.69.0","target_commitish":"main","name":"v0.69.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-12T20:19:57Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T03:36:07Z","published_at":"2026-10-12T20:20:00Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/