s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":616,"digest":"sha256:94f5e739b9905aaa73f200ca69a3375dea6a218d835fc7605936f57a6f589373","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-10-11T03:16:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T03:16:42Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.64.0/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.64.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.64.0","body":"### Added\n\n- *(deps)* [**breaking**] link the oneagentgraph and onejudge with judge settings ([#840](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/840))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.5.6 | `0.5.6` | 0.5.6 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.43.1 | `0.43.1` | 0.43.1 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.13.4 | `0.13.4` | 0.13.4 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.19.0 | `0.19.0` | 0.19.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.24.2 | `0.24.1` | 0.24.2 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.3.11 | `=0.3.11` | 0.3.11 |\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A newer release of an engine below exists that this build's own requirements\n> **hold back**: it requires a sibling engine outside the window `Cargo.toml` states,\n> so no `cargo update` takes it without a second copy of that sibling, and only a\n> requirement move lifts it:\n>\n> - `onevcs-testing` links 0.13.4, the newest its requirement permits that this manifest admits; 0.