"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":620,"digest":"sha256:391ad2230f8f9f2677a4991a615a6ee027e3218e0f577cfc5a8ba0395d5fc8b7","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-10-10T06:31:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T06:31:43Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.63.7/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.63.7","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.63.7","body":"### Added\n\n- *(deps)* link the onetaskgraph release that prints a project's dependency graph ([#833](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/833))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.5.5 | `0.5.5` | 0.5.5 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.43.1 | `0.43.1` | 0.43.1 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.13.4 | `0.13.4` | 0.13.4 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.17.2 | `0.17.1` | 0.17.2 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.24.2 | `0.24.1` | 0.24.2 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.3.11 | `=0.3.11` | 0.3.11 |\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A newer release of an engine below exists that this build's own requirements\n> **hold back**: it requires a sibling engine outside the window `Cargo.toml` states,\n> so no `cargo update` takes it without a second copy of that sibling, and only a\n> requirement move lifts it:\n>\n> - `onevcs-testing` links 0.13.4, the newest its requirement permits that this manifest admits; 0.13.6 is held back by `onevcs = \"0.43.1\"` (0.13.6 requires onevcs =0.44.1).\n\nEvery linked engine is the newest its own requirement permits among the releases this manifest admits.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/408210081","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/408210081/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/408210081/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.63.6","id":408210081,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOTx8aUc4YVMqh","tag_name":"v0.63.6","target_commitish":"main","name":"v0.63.6","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-09T18:19:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T19:51:44Z","published_at":"2026-10-09T18:19:29Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/assets/625960043","id":625960043,"node_id":"RA_kwDOTx8aUc4lT2Rr","name":"onepipeline-v0.63.6-aarch64-apple-darwin.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"l