],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.63.5","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.63.5","body":"### Fixed\n\n- *(channel)* let a cancel preempt the live note its node has not answered ([#819](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/819))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.5.5 | `0.5.5` | 0.5.5 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.42.2 | `0.42.2` | 0.42.2 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.13.2 | `0.13.2` | 0.13.2 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.17.2 | `0.17.1` | 0.17.2 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.24.2 | `0.24.1` | 0.24.2 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.3.9 | `=0.3.9` | 0.3.9 |\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A newer release of an engine below exists that this build's own requirements\n> **hold back**: it requires a sibling engine outside the window `Cargo.toml` states,\n> so no `cargo update` takes it without a second copy of that sibling, and only a\n> requirement move lifts it:\n>\n> - `onevcs-testing` links 0.13.2, the newest its requirement permits that this manifest admits; 0.13.4 is held back by `onevcs = \"0.42.2\"` (0.13.4 requires onevcs =0.43.1).\n\nEvery linked engine is the newest its own requirement permits among the releases this manifest admits.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/407415887","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/407415887/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/407415887/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.63.4","id":407415887,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":""