dded\n\n- *(deps)* [**breaking**] link the onetaskgraph release that maps statuses per item kind ([#775](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/775))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.5.5 | `0.5.5` | 0.5.5 |\n| `onevcs` | **0.42.0** | `0.42.0` | **0.42.1** — this release is behind it |\n| `onevcs-testing` | **0.13.0** | `0.13.0` | **0.13.1** — this release is behind it |\n| `onejudge` | **0.17.1** | `0.17.1` | **0.17.2** — this release is behind it |\n| `oneharness-core` | **0.24.1** | `0.24.1` | **0.24.2** — this release is behind it |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.3.2 | `=0.3.2` | 0.3.2 |\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This release links an engine **older than its own requirement permits**, so reading\n> `Cargo.toml` overstates what this build contains:\n>\n> - `onevcs` links 0.42.0; the requirement already permitted 0.42.1.\n> - `onevcs-testing` links 0.13.0; the requirement already permitted 0.13.1.\n> - `onejudge` links 0.17.1; the requirement already permitted 0.17.2.\n> - `oneharness-core` links 0.24.1; the requirement already permitted 0.24.2.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/405347280","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/405347280/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/405347280/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.62.0","id":405347280,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickdero