/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.62.0/onepipeline-v0.62.0-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/assets/617826589","id":617826589,"node_id":"RA_kwDOTx8aUc4k00kd","name":"release-outcome.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":616,"digest":"sha256:707f37fc2272b4ce1a799f6fa102005dfb82a081c241d9a0c709d6b272cd8625","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-10-07T06:38:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T06:38:22Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.62.0/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.62.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.62.0","body":"### Added\n\n- *(lifecycle)* let a preserved node build on a preserved dependency ([#776](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/776))\n- *(templates)* register project templates and check a stored project's rendering ([#778](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/778))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.5.5 | `0.5.5` | 0.5.5 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.42.0 | `0.42.0` | 0.42.0 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.13.0 | `0.13.0` | 0.13.0 |\n| `onejudge` | **0.17.1** | `0.17.1` | **0.17.2** — this release is behind it |\n| `oneharness-core` | **0.24.1** | `0.24.1` | **0.24.2** — this release is behind it |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.3.2 | `=0.3.2` | 0.3.2 |\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This release links an engine **older than its own requirement permits**, so reading\n> `Cargo.toml` overstates what this build contains:\n>\n> - `onejudge` links 0.17.1; the requirement already permitted 0.17.2.\n> - `oneharness-core` links 0.24.1; the requirement already permitted 0.24.2.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/405079475","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/405079475/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/405079475/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.61.1","id":405079475,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users