ts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":616,"digest":"sha256:8f9024c4ccc37bbf34a8203ed36d6242f2695ad513440cd475ce2fd125f9497e","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-10-04T19:05:14Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T19:05:15Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.60.5/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.60.5","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.60.5","body":"### Fixed\n\n- *(test)* keep the pacing and wake-budget journeys deterministic on a slow runner ([#738](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/738))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.5.5 | `0.5.5` | 0.5.5 |\n| `onevcs` | **0.40.2** | `0.40.2` | **0.40.3** — this release is behind it |\n| `onevcs-testing` | **0.12.2** | `0.12.2` | **0.12.3** — this release is behind it |\n| `onejudge` | 0.17.1 | `0.17.1` | 0.17.1 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.24.1 | `0.24.1` | 0.24.1 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.2.58 | `=0.2.58` | 0.2.58 |\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This release links an engine **older than its own requirement permits**, so reading\n> `Cargo.toml` overstates what this build contains:\n>\n> - `onevcs` links 0.40.2; the requirement already permitted 0.40.3.\n> - `onevcs-testing` links 0.12.2; the requirement already permitted 0.12.3.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/402839787","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/rel