rtis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.60.3","body":"### Fixed\n\n- *(deps)* link the onevcs and onetaskgraph releases with these fixes ([#724](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/724))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.5.5 | `0.5.5` | 0.5.5 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.39.0 | `0.39.0` | 0.39.0 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.11.1 | `0.11.1` | 0.11.1 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.17.1 | `0.17.1` | 0.17.1 |\n| `oneharness-core` | **0.24.0** | `0.24.0` | **0.24.1** — this release is behind it |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.2.58 | `=0.2.58` | 0.2.58 |\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This release links an engine **older than its own requirement permits**, so reading\n> `Cargo.toml` overstates what this build contains:\n>\n> - `oneharness-core` links 0.24.0; the requirement already permitted 0.24.1.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/402656058","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/402656058/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/402656058/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.60.2","id":402656058,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gith