watch ([#717](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/717))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.5.5 | `0.5.5` | 0.5.5 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.38.0 | `0.38.0` | 0.38.0 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.11.0 | `0.11.0` | 0.11.0 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.17.1 | `0.17.1` | 0.17.1 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.24.0 | `0.24.0` | 0.24.0 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.2.57 | `=0.2.57` | 0.2.57 |\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A newer release of an engine below exists that this build's own requirements\n> **hold back**: it requires a sibling engine outside the window `Cargo.toml` states,\n> so no `cargo update` takes it without a second copy of that sibling, and only a\n> requirement move lifts it:\n>\n> - `onevcs-testing` links 0.11.0, the newest its requirement permits that this manifest admits; 0.11.1 is held back by `onevcs = \"0.38.0\"` (0.11.1 requires onevcs =0.39.0).\n\nEvery linked engine is the newest its own requirement permits among the releases this manifest admits.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/402422973","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/402422973/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/402422973/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.60.1","id":402422973,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_u