ns","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":616,"digest":"sha256:b96032abd2a47a24c03b147a77de3f35237b67172f28a323e1d7231c96e7e98d","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-10-03T03:55:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T03:55:22Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.59.0/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.59.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.59.0","body":"### Added\n\n- *(views)* read a run's ending from its hook verdict and print it as JSON ([#694](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/694))\n- *(journal)* record every driver's ending with its settlement and last answered command ([#691](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/691))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(unwatched)* keep a detached driver's run document current with its journal at handback ([#702](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/702))\n- *(hooks)* start a new hook epoch when an adoption finds the graph live ([#699](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/699))\n- *(tests)* remove the races behind the write-back and summary flakes ([#683](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/683))\n- *(ci)* name why a test leg stopped and whether a failed test reproduces ([#670](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/670))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.5.5 | `0.5.5` | 0.5.5 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.37.0 | `0.37.0` | 0.37.0 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.10.0 | `0.10.0` | 0.10.0 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.17.1 | `0.17.1` | 0.17.1 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.24.0 | `0.24.0` | 0.24.0 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.2.54 | `=0.2.54` | 0.2.54 |\n\nEvery linked engine is the newest its own requirement permits.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/401731564","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/401731564/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/401731564/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.58.0","id":401731564,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOTx8aUc4X8e_s","tag_name":"v0.58.0","target_commitish":"main","name":"v0.58.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-