"name":"release-outcome.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":616,"digest":"sha256:77683a7448f5ff8fe01ee15cb977b77fa46b44ab17becd9b5ad90f871e843175","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-01T03:54:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T03:54:44Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.56.0/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.56.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.56.0","body":"### Added\n\n- *(templates)* let a template layer extend the same name in a lower layer ([#614](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/614))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(deps)* link the harness stack whose history never scans ([#613](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/613))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.5.5 | `0.5.5` | 0.5.5 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.35.0 | `0.35.0` | 0.35.0 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.8.6 | `0.8.6` | 0.8.6 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.17.1 | `0.17.1` | 0.17.1 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.24.0 | `0.24.0` | 0.24.0 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.2.52 | `=0.2.52` | 0.2.52 |\n\nEvery linked engine is the newest its own requirement permits.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/400408165","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/400408165/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/400408165/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.55.0","id":400408165,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"R