nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.53.1/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.53.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.53.1","body":"### Fixed\n\n- *(deps)* link the onetaskgraph release that gives copied tasks destination-scoped ids ([#580](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/580))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.5.3 | `0.5.2` | 0.5.3 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.34.1 | `0.34.1` | 0.34.1 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.8.5 | `0.8.5` | 0.8.5 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.14.0 | `0.14.0` | 0.14.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.18.0 | `0.18.0` | 0.18.0 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.2.51 | `=0.2.51` | 0.2.51 |\n\nEvery linked engine is the newest its own requirement permits.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/399023729","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/399023729/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/399023729/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.53.0","id":399023729,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscripti