son","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":616,"digest":"sha256:957bcf77a1179a9aa08e000ff2d17143e89223d08ec1327f5b531ca0b756edf6","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-29T12:03:08Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T12:03:08Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.53.0/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.53.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.53.0","body":"### Added\n\n- *(views)* add `status --no-providers` and `watch --log PATH` ([#574](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/574))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(engine)* deliver live manager notes off the run's single writer ([#573](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/573))\n- *(deps)* link the onetaskgraph release that filters tasks by comment activity ([#575](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/575))\n- *(lifecycle)* name the published tip in a re-dispatch and require commits on top of it ([#569](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/569))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | **0.5.2** | `0.5.2` | **0.5.3** — this release is behind it |\n| `onevcs` | 0.34.1 | `0.34.1` | 0.34.1 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.8.5 | `0.8.5` | 0.8.5 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.14.0 | `0.14.0` | 0.14.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.18.0 | `0.18.0` | 0.18.0 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.2.50 | `=0.2.50` | 0.2.50 |\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> This release links an engine **older than its own requirement permits**, so reading\n> `Cargo.toml` overstates what this build contains:\n>\n> - `oneagentgraph` links 0.5.2; the requirement already permitted 0.5.3.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/398301103","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/398301103/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/398301103/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/tag/v0.52.1","id":398301103,"author":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobe