-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":616,"digest":"sha256:4c1404ecaa69e8b756e6134e414909a872d6cdaff078092d7104e546de951fd3","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-27T22:44:12Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T22:44:12Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.51.0/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.51.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.51.0","body":"### Added\n\n- *(lifecycle)* record the branches a landed retry superseded and retire finished branches when idle ([#543](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/543))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(retirement)* keep branches a node names mid-sweep, and lock and validate supersession recording ([#553](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/553))\n- *(release)* build the Linux wheels now that the linked store brings vendored OpenSSL ([#550](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/550))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.5.2 | `0.5.2` | 0.5.2 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.34.1 | `0.34.1` | 0.34.1 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.8.5 | `0.8.5` | 0.8.5 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.14.0 | `0.14.0` | 0.14.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.18.0 | `0.18.0` | 0.18.0 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.2.46 | `=0.2.46` | 0.2.46 |\n\nEvery linked engine is the newest its own requirement permits.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/397690197","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/397690197/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/rele