download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-27T16:17:59Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T16:17:59Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/releases/download/v0.50.1/release-outcome.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/tarball/v0.50.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/zipball/v0.50.1","body":"### Added\n\n- *(writeback)* read a delivered ticket's failure class through onetaskgraph's typed accessor ([#546](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/546))\n\n<!-- linked-engines -->\n### Linked engines\n\nThe sibling engines this release actually links, resolved from its own `Cargo.lock`:\n\n| Engine | Linked | Requirement | Newest the requirement permits |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `oneagentgraph` | 0.5.2 | `0.5.2` | 0.5.2 |\n| `onevcs` | 0.33.0 | `0.33.0` | 0.33.0 |\n| `onevcs-testing` | 0.8.3 | `0.8.3` | 0.8.3 |\n| `onejudge` | 0.14.0 | `0.14.0` | 0.14.0 |\n| `oneharness-core` | 0.18.0 | `0.18.0` | 0.18.0 |\n| `onetaskgraph-core` | 0.2.46 | `=0.2.46` | 0.2.46 |\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A newer release of an engine below exists that this build's own requirements\n> **hold back**: it requires a sibling engine outside the window `Cargo.toml` states,\n> so no `cargo update` takes it without a second copy of that sibling, and only a\n> requirement move lifts it:\n>\n> - `onevcs-testing` links 0.8.3, the newest its requirement permits that this manifest admits; 0.8.5 is held back by `onevcs = \"0.33.0\"` (0.8.5 requires onevcs ^0.34.1).\n\nEvery linked engine is the newest its own requirement permits among the releases this manifest admits.\n"}]